01:02:18.440 --> 01:02:21.599
one in our series of
Big Data to Knowledge Guide to the Fundamentals

01:02:21.599 --> 01:02:22.630
of Data Science.

01:02:22.630 --> 01:02:23.630
Thank you, everybody.

01:02:23.630 --> 01:02:24.630
Have a great day.

